{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/a048f01a908feefa1dc40e92f1c8e3b7.poster.avif?t=1773063602\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/a048f01a908feefa1dc40e92f1c8e3b7.webm?t=1773063602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/a048f01a908feefa1dc40e92f1c8e3b7.mp4?t=1773063602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/68fab97b37b46c90fb2c5484dc67ba97.webp?t=1773063602\" width=560 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cards to plant and grow seeds to restore life in an apocalyptic world. Unlock and build powerful synergies, confront bosses and discover the history of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/34f81da3724db4f9dca39baa2293557c.poster.avif?t=1773063602\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/34f81da3724db4f9dca39baa2293557c.webm?t=1773063602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/34f81da3724db4f9dca39baa2293557c.mp4?t=1773063602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different plants have different requirements, shapes and effects. Place them strategically to cover the land taken over by the anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/58191c8b0b4f25cd47e59f00fb1bb4c8.webp?t=1773063602\" width=515 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After successfully restoring nature in each island, different plants and colours will cover the land depending on your deck and play style, changing the final look of the maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/14ad77dbf8e84141a2bafa608f9a0b0c.poster.avif?t=1773063602\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/14ad77dbf8e84141a2bafa608f9a0b0c.webm?t=1773063602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/14ad77dbf8e84141a2bafa608f9a0b0c.mp4?t=1773063602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a consequence of mistreatment by humans, the Earth deteriorates to its limit causing the appearance of anomalies: unexplainable phenomena in which natural laws are altered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over time, humanity is decimated and transformed, new ways of interpreting the forces of nature emerge, and a deep devotion to flowers arises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only hope for this new society is that growing plants and caring for the Earth can restore order in the planet.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3577070?t=1773063602","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/0529bf056d9ce81707b29c0f5c19cabd4ebdb1ac/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773063602","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/4408bb884ee3f94cbcadba8dd07739214606dee7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773063602","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/4408bb884ee3f94cbcadba8dd07739214606dee7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773063602","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3808320,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/a048f01a908feefa1dc40e92f1c8e3b7.poster.avif?t=1773063602\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/a048f01a908feefa1dc40e92f1c8e3b7.webm?t=1773063602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/a048f01a908feefa1dc40e92f1c8e3b7.mp4?t=1773063602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/68fab97b37b46c90fb2c5484dc67ba97.webp?t=1773063602\" width=560 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cards to plant and grow seeds to restore life in an apocalyptic world. Unlock and build powerful synergies, confront bosses and discover the history of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/34f81da3724db4f9dca39baa2293557c.poster.avif?t=1773063602\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/34f81da3724db4f9dca39baa2293557c.webm?t=1773063602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/34f81da3724db4f9dca39baa2293557c.mp4?t=1773063602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different plants have different requirements, shapes and effects. Place them strategically to cover the land taken over by the anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/58191c8b0b4f25cd47e59f00fb1bb4c8.webp?t=1773063602\" width=515 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After successfully restoring nature in each island, different plants and colours will cover the land depending on your deck and play style, changing the final look of the maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/14ad77dbf8e84141a2bafa608f9a0b0c.poster.avif?t=1773063602\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/14ad77dbf8e84141a2bafa608f9a0b0c.webm?t=1773063602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/14ad77dbf8e84141a2bafa608f9a0b0c.mp4?t=1773063602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a consequence of mistreatment by humans, the Earth deteriorates to its limit causing the appearance of anomalies: unexplainable phenomena in which natural laws are altered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over time, humanity is decimated and transformed, new ways of interpreting the forces of nature emerge, and a deep devotion to flowers arises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only hope for this new society is that growing plants and caring for the Earth can restore order in the planet.</p>","developers":["Ceiling Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/9a2f30edc76e3b1a5826ec3e1d4222f15efd7dae/header.jpg?t=1773063602","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3577070/786690044/bf9e0db99c6a6a818fc23f16531e5120d2d55fbd/1773062486/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773063601","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3577070/786690044/bf9e0db99c6a6a818fc23f16531e5120d2d55fbd/1773062486/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773063601","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3577070/786690044/bf9e0db99c6a6a818fc23f16531e5120d2d55fbd/1773062486/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773063601","id":257142836,"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257142836/1a68b778afa9081b2d6955ed543f08e0218abde5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1773063601"}],"name":"The Solace of Flowers","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 460<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 960,